  <para style="h">Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu ca Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Neh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu ca</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NEH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Isengesho rya Nehemiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 1:1" />Aya ni amajambo ya Nehemiya mwene Hakaliya:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 1:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:1">Mu kwezi kwa Kisilevu mu mwaka ugira mirongo ibiri, umwami Aritazeruzi ari ku ngoma, nari ku mugwa i Suza. <verse eid="NEH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 1:2" />Hanani, umwe mu bo tuvukana, aza avuye i Buyuda ari kumwe n’abandi bagabo bamwe, maze ndababaza amakuru y’amasigarira y’Abayuda batashe bavuye mu kinyago, n’ivyerekeye Yerusalemu.<verse eid="NEH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 1:3" />Barambwira bati: “Abarokotse mu bari barajanywe ari inyagano, bakaba baragarutse mu ntara y’iwabo i Buyuda, bari mu mibabaro myinshi no mu biteterwe. Uruzitiro rw’i Yerusalemu rwarasenyutse, kandi n’amarembo yaho yatongojwe umuriro.”<verse eid="NEH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 1:4" />Maze kwumva ivyo, nicara hasi ndarira. Mara imisi ngandaye nisonzesheje kandi nsenga Imana yo mw’ijuru. <verse eid="NEH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 1:5" />Maze ndavuga nti:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NEH 1:5">“Yewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Mana yo mw’ijuru, Mana nkuru kandi uhambaye, uzigama isezerano ryawe ry’urukundo wagiranye n’abagukunda kandi bubaha amabwirizwa yawe, <verse eid="NEH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 1:6" />ndakwinginze untege ugutwi kandi inyonga zawe ntizive kuri jewe, wumve ugusenga kw’umusavyi wawe ndiko ndasengera imbere yawe ku murango no mw’ijoro nsengera abasavyi bawe ari bo Bisirayeli. Ndatuye ivyaha twebwe Abisirayeli, na jewe ndimwo n’umuryango wa data, twakoze tugucumurako. <verse eid="NEH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 1:7" />Twakoze ibibi vyinshi mu nyonga zawe. Ntitwitondeye ivyo wategetse, amabwirizwa n’ivyagezwe vyawe ivyo wahaye umusavyi wawe Mose.<verse eid="NEH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 1:8" />Wibuke ivyo wabwiye umusavyi wawe Mose, uvuga uti: ‘Nimutaba abizigirwa, nzobasanzariza mu yandi mahanga, <verse eid="NEH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 1:9" />ariko nimwangarukako maze mukumvira ivyo nategetse, nanje naho abantu banyu bazoba barasanzaye bagashika ku mpera y’isi, nzobegeranya ndabakureyo ndabagarukane mu kibanza natoranije ngo Izina ryanje abe ari ho riba.’<verse eid="NEH 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 1:10" />Ni abasavyi bawe kandi ni ubwoko bwawe, abo wacunguye ukoresheje ubushobozi bwawe n’ukuboko kwawe gukomeye. <verse eid="NEH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 1:11" />Yewe Uhoraho, niwumve ugusenga kw’umusavyi wawe n’ugusenga kw’abasavyi bawe bahimbarwa no kwubaha izina ryawe. Uhe umusavyi wawe kuroranirwa uwu musi ngo aze kugira ikiganza ciza imbere y’uwu muntu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:11">Nari njejwe guhereza ibinyobwa umwami.<verse eid="NEH 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NEH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Aritazeruzi arungika Nehemiya i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 2:1" />Mu kwezi kwa Nisani mu mwaka ugira mirongo ibiri umwami Ahasuwerusi ari ku ngoma, igihe umuvinyu wari imbere yiwe, ndawakira ndawumuhereza. Sinari bwigere mboneka mbabaye ndi imbere yiwe; <verse eid="NEH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 2:2" />ni ho umwami yambaza ati: “Ni kubera iki mu maso hawe hijirirwe kandi utagwaye? Ivyo ntibiva ku kindi atari umubabaro wo mu mutima.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:2">Ngira ubwoba bwinshi cane, <verse eid="NEH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 2:3" />ariko nishura umwami nti: “Uragahora ku ngoma mwami! Mbega noreka kugira umubabaro gute kandi igisagara ba sogokuruza bahambwemwo gisigaye ari umusaka, kandi n’amarembo yaho akaba yaratongowe n’umuriro?”<verse eid="NEH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 2:4" />Umwami arambaza ati: “None wipfuza iki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:4">Nuko nca nsenga Imana yo mw’ijuru, <verse eid="NEH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 2:5" />maze nishura umwami nti: “Nivyaba biguhimbaye mwami kandi nkaba ngiriwe ubuntu mu nyonga zawe, undungike mu gisagara c’i Buyuda aho ba sogokuruza bahambwe kugira ngo nshobore kugisanura.”<verse eid="NEH 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 2:6" />Maze umwami, aho yari yicaranye n’umwamikazi, arambaza ati: “Mbega urugendo rwawe ruzomara imisi ingahe, uzogaruka ryari?” Maze bihimbara umwami kundeka ngo ngende; nanje ndamubwira imisi nzomara.<verse eid="NEH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 2:7" />Ndongera ndamubwira nti: “Nivyaba biguhimbaye, mwami, umpe amakete nzoha abakuru b’intara bo mu burengero bw’uruzi Efurate, kugira ngo bandeke ndengane gushika i Buyuda. <verse eid="NEH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 2:8" />Kandi umpe n’ikete rya Asafu, uwujejwe amashamba y’umwami, kugira ngo aze ampe imbaho zo kumanika maze kwubaka amarembo y’umugwa, i ruhande y’Ingoro, kwubaka uruzitiro rw’igisagara hamwe n’inzu nzobamwo.” Kandi kubera ikiganza ciza c’Imana yanje cari kuri jewe, umwami ampa ivyo ndamusavye. <verse eid="NEH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 2:9" />Nuko ngenda ku bakuru b’intara zo mu burengero bw’uruzi Efurate ndabaha ayo makete y’umwami. Kandi umwami yari yarungitse abakuru b’ingabo n’abagendera ku mafarasi ngo bamperekeze.<verse eid="NEH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 2:10" />Sanibalati Umuhoroni na Tobiya umukuru w’Umwamoni bumvise ivyo, birabababaza cane kuko haje umuntu aje kugirira neza Abisirayeli.<verse eid="NEH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nehemiya agendura uruzitiro rw’i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 2:11" />Nuko nja i Yerusalemu, ndahamara imisi itatu. <verse eid="NEH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 2:12" />Maze ndasohoka mw’ijoro turi kumwe n’abantu bakeya. Sinari nabwiye umuntu n’umwe ico Imana yari yashize ku mutima wanje co gukorera i Yerusalemu. Nta bindi bitungwa vyo kugenderako vyari bihari kiretse indogoba nagenderako.<verse eid="NEH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 2:13" />Muri iryo joro ndasohoka nca mw’Irembo ryo mu Kiyaya nerekeye kw’iriba ry’imbwebwe no kw’Irembo ry’Umwavu, nihweza inzitiro z’i Yerusalemu, ingene zasenyutse, n’amarembo yaho ingene yahiye. <verse eid="NEH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 2:14" />Nuko ndabandanya nerekeye kw’Irembo ry’Iriba riri hafi y’ikidengeri c’umwami, ariko indogoba nagenderako ntiyashobora kuronka aho ica hakwiye ngo irengane. <verse eid="NEH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 2:15" />Maze nca ndugana ikiyaya mw’ijoro, nihweza uruzitiro. Kw’iherezo, nca ndahindukira ninjirira mw’Irembo ryo mu Kiyaya. <verse eid="NEH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 2:16" />Abakuru ntibamenye iyo nagiye canke ico nariko ndakora, kuko ntari bwabwire ikintu na kimwe Abayuda canke abaherezi canke abubahwa canke abakuru canke abandi bantu bari gukora ico gikorwa.<verse eid="NEH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 2:17" />Nuko ndababwira nti: “Murabona aya magorwa turimwo: Yerusalemu ni umusaka, kandi amarembo yaho yarahiye. Nimuze, twubake uruzitiro rw’i Yerusalemu, kugira ngo twikureko igitutsi.” <verse eid="NEH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 2:18" />Nongera ndababwira ingene ikiganza ciza c’Imana yanje cabanye nanje n’ivyo umwami yambwiye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:18">Bishurira rimwe bati: “Reka dutangure kwongera kwubaka.” Nuko batangura gukora ico gikorwa ciza.<verse eid="NEH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 2:19" />Ariko Sanibalati Umuhoroni, Tobiya umukuru w’Umwamoni na Geshemu Umwarabu bavyumvise, baraducokora baradukengera. Barabaza bati: “Ivyo muriko murakora ni ibiki? Muriko muragarariza umwami?”<verse eid="NEH 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 2:20" />Ndabishura ndababwira nti: “Imana yo mw’ijuru ni yo izotuma tubishobora. Twebwe abasavyi bayo tugira dutangure gusanura, ariko mwebwe, nta mugabane mufise, canke uburenganzira na bumwe canke iragi i Yerusalemu.”<verse eid="NEH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NEH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Abubatsi b’uruzitiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 3:1" />Eliyashibu umuherezi mukuru na bagenziwe b’abaherezi bava hasi barakora, bubaka Irembo ry’Intama. Barishikiriza Imana bashirako n’inzugi, barubaka bashika ku Munara wa Meya, bahashikanira Imana, no gushika ku Munara wa Hananeli. <verse eid="NEH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 3:2" />Abantu b’i Yeriko bubaka igice co hagati, Zakuri na we mwene Imuri yubaka i ruhande yabo.<verse eid="NEH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 3:3" />Irembo ry’Amafi ryubakwa na bene Hasenaya. Bashiraho imyamba basakarirako baca batera inzugi bashiraho n’ibihindizo vyo kugumya urugi iyo rwugaye. <verse eid="NEH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 3:4" />Meremoti mwene Uriya, mwene Hakozi, asanura igice gikurikira. Akurikirwa na Meshulamu mwene Berekiya, mwene Meshezabeli, arasanura, akurikirwa na Zadoki mwene Bayana na we nyene arasanura. <verse eid="NEH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 3:5" />Igice gikurikira gisanurwa n’abantu b’i Tekowa, ariko abubahwa babo ntibagira ico bakora ngo bumvire umukuru wabo.<verse eid="NEH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 3:6" />Irembo Rishaje, ari ryo rya Yeshana, risanurwa na Yohiyada mwene Paseya hamwe na Meshulamu mwene Besodeya. Bashiraho ibishimaryango, baterako inzugi, bashiraho n’ibihindizo vyo kugumya urugi iyo rwugaye. <verse eid="NEH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 3:7" />Bakurikirwa n’abantu b’i Gibeyoni n’i Misipa, Melatiya w’i Gibeyoni na Yadoni w’i Meronoti, batwarwa n’umukuru atwara intara zo mu burengero bw’uruzi Efurate. <verse eid="NEH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 3:8" />Uziyeli mwene Harihaya, umwe mu bacuzi b’inzahabu, asanura igice gikurikira; na Hananiya, umwe mu bahinga bahingura ibimota neza, asanura ahakurikira aho. Basanura Yerusalemu gushika ku ruzitiro rwagutse. <verse eid="NEH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 3:9" />Refaya mwene Huri, yaganza igice kimwe c’i Yerusalemu, asanura igice gikurikira. <verse eid="NEH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 3:10" />I ruhande yabo, Yedaya mwene Harumafi asanura ahatumberanye n’inzu yiwe, Hatushi mwene Hashabuneya na we asanura igice gikurikira. <verse eid="NEH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 3:11" />Malikiya mwene Harimu na Hashubi mwene Pahati-Mowabu asanura ikindi gice n’umunara w’amatanure. <verse eid="NEH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 3:12" />Shalumu mwene Haloheshi, uwaganza igice kimwe c’i Yerusalemu, asanura igice gikurikira afashijwe n’abakobwa biwe.<verse eid="NEH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 3:13" />Irembo ryo mu Kiyaya ryasanuwe na Hanuni n’ababa i Zanowa. Bararyubaka bashirako n’inzugi zaho, bashiraho n’ibihindizo vyo kugumya urugi iyo rwugaye. Barongera basanura uruzitiro ahantu hangana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko igihumbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 450.</char></note> gushika kw’Irembo ry’Umwavu.<verse eid="NEH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 3:14" />Irembo ry’Umwavu risanurwa na Malikiya mwene Rekabu, uwaganza intara y’i Beti-Hakeremu. Araryubaka ashirako n’inzugi zaho, ashiraho n’ibihindizo vyo kugumya urugi iyo rwugaye.<verse eid="NEH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 3:15" />Irembo ry’Iriba ryasanuwe na Shaluni mwene Koli-Hoze, uwaganza intara ya Misipa. Araryubaka, ararisakara ashirako n’inzugi, ashiraho n’ibihindizo vyo kugumya urugi iyo rwugaye. Yongera asanura uruzitiro rwo ku kidengeri c’i Silowamu, i ruhande y’umurima w’umwami, gushika ku ngazi zimanuka ziva mu Gisagara ca Dawidi. <verse eid="NEH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 3:16" />Hakurikira Nehemiya mwene Azibuki, uwaganza igice c’intara ya Beti-Zuri, arasanura ageza aharabana no ku mva ya Dawidi, gushika ku kidengeri kibika amazi kiri hafi y’inzu y’abahizi.<verse eid="NEH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 3:17" />Abalewi barongowe na Rehumu mwene Bani barakurikira barasanura. Bakurikirwa na Hashabiya, uwaganza igice c’intara ya Keyila, arasanura ku bw’akarere abamwo. <verse eid="NEH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 3:18" />Hakurikira n’abandi benewabo b’Abalewi bari barongowe na Binuwi mwene Henadadi, uwaganza ikindi gice c’ako karere k’i Keyila, barahasanura. <verse eid="NEH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 3:19" />Hakurikira Ezeri mwene Yesuwa, uwaganza i Misipa, asanura igice gikurikira, uhereye aharabana n’ingazi yo ku bubiko bw’ibigwanisho kugeza aho uruzitiro rukatira. <verse eid="NEH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 3:20" />Hakurikira Baruki mwene Zakayi akorana umwete mu gusanura ikindi gice, kuva aho uruzitiro rukatira gushika ku rwinjiriro rw’inzu ya Eliyashibu umuherezi mukuru. <verse eid="NEH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 3:21" />Hakurikira Meremoti mwene Uriya, mwene Hakozi, asanura ikindi gice, kuva ku rwinjiriro rw’inzu ya Eliyashibu gushika aho ruherera.<verse eid="NEH 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 3:22" />Abakurikiye mu gusanura bari abaherezi bo mu karere kahakikuje. <verse eid="NEH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 3:23" />Bakurikirwa na Benyamini na Hashubi, basanura imbere y’inzu yabo; baca bakurikirwa na Azariya mwene Mayaseya, mwene Ananiya, asanura i ruhande y’inzu yiwe. <verse eid="NEH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 3:24" />Akurikirwa na Binuwi mwene Henadadi, asanura ikindi gice, uhereye ku nzu kwa Azariya gushika aho uruzitiro rukatira no mu mfuruka, <verse eid="NEH 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 3:25" />maze Palali mwene Uziya akora aharabana n’aho uruzitiro rukatira n’umunara urabana n’ikirimba co haruguru hafi y’urugo rw’umurinzi. Hakurikira Pedaya mwene Paroshi <verse eid="NEH 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 3:26" />n’abakozi bo mu Ngoro baba ku musozi wa Ofeli, basanura kugeza aharabana n’Irembo ry’Amazi werekeje mu buseruko n’umunara ku ruhome. <verse eid="NEH 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 3:27" />Abantu b’i Tekowa barakurikira, basanura ikindi gice, kuva ku munara w’abararira urusengero gushika ku ruzitiro rwa Ofeli.<verse eid="NEH 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 3:28" />Hejuru y’Irembo ry’Amafarasi, abaherezi barahasanura, umwe wese asanura imbere y’inzu yiwe. <verse eid="NEH 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 3:29" />Bakurikirwa na Zadoki mwene Imeri, asanura aharabana n’inzu yiwe, Akurikirwa na Shemaya mwene Shekaniya, umurinzi wo kw’Irembo ryo mu Buseruko, arahasanura. <verse eid="NEH 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 3:30" />Hananiya mwene Shelemiya, na Hanuni, umuhungu wa gatandatu wa Zalafu barakurikira, basanura ikindi gice. Hakurikira Meshulamu mwene Berekiya asanura imbere y’icumba ciwe. <verse eid="NEH 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 3:31" />Malikiya, umwe mu bacuzi b’inzahabu arakurikira, asanura gushika ku nzu y’abakozi bo mu Ngoro n’abadandaza, aharabana n’Irembo ry’Ubugenduzi, no gushika ku cumba kiri hejuru y’aho uruzitiro rukatira. <verse eid="NEH 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 3:32" />Hagati y’icumba kiri hejuru y’aho uruzitiro rugarukira n’Irembo ry’Intama ni ho abacuzi b’inzahabu n’abadandaza basanuye.<verse eid="NEH 3:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NEH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Bagwanya igikorwa co gusanura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 4:1" />Sanibalati yumvise ko turiko turubaka uruzitiro, arashavura cane, uburake buramusaza. Aca acokora Abayuda, <verse eid="NEH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 4:2" />maze ari imbere y’abari bamushigikiye hamwe n’ingabo z’i Samariya, avuga ati: “Abo Bayuda b’abanyantegenke bariko barakora ibiki? Bazoshobora gusanura uruzitiro rwabo? Bazotanga ibimazi? Bibaza ko boruheza ku musi umwe? Boshobora kugarukana arya mabuye bayakuye mu misaka yahiye, n’ukuntu yahiye?”<verse eid="NEH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 4:3" />Tobiya Umwamoni yari i ruhande yiwe na we avuga ati: “Ivyo bariko barubakisha amabuye, n’imbwebwe yovyurirako, vyosenyukira hasi vyose!”<verse eid="NEH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 4:4" />Maze nca ndasenga nti: “Dutege amatwi, yewe Mana yacu, kubw’aka gakengerwe. Uhindukize ivyo bitutsi vyabo bibe ari bo bisubira ku mitwe. Ivyabo binyagwe bari mu kinyago. <verse eid="NEH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 4:5" />Ntutwikire ibigabitanyo vyabo canke ngo ukure imbere yawe ivyaha vyabo, kuko batutse abubatsi bari ku gikorwa.”<verse eid="NEH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 4:6" />Nuko turubaka uruzitiro gushika rugeze hagati, kuko abantu bakora n’umutima wabo wose.<verse eid="NEH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 4:7" />Ariko Sanibalati, Tobiya n’Abarabu, Abamoni n’abantu b’i Ashidodi bumvise ko ugusanura uruzitiro rw’i Yerusalemu kubandanya kandi ko ibihengeri bimaze kuzibirwa, barashavura cane. <verse eid="NEH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 4:8" />Baca baja inama ngo baze kugwanya ab’i Yerusalemu kugira ngo batuburagize. <verse eid="NEH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 4:9" />Ariko dusenga Imana yacu dushiraho n’abarinzi ku murango no mw’ijoro ngo twikingire.<verse eid="NEH 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 4:10" />Muri ico gihe, abantu b’i Buyuda bari bavuze bati: “Abubatsi bagenda bacika intege, kandi isakamburira ni ryinshi cane ku buryo tudashobora gusanura uruzitiro.”<verse eid="NEH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 4:11" />Maze abansi bacu baravuga bati: “Tuzogenda tububire batabizi, tubice, igikorwa gihagarare.”<verse eid="NEH 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 4:12" />Ariko Abayuda babana na bo baca baza kutuburira, batubwiye incuro icumi zose bati: “Aho mutumbera hose, mumenye ko bazoza kudutera.”<verse eid="NEH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 4:13" />Nuko nca nshira abantu ahantu hose h’urutiziro hameze nk’ahacokeye, baja ahantu habona, ndabatora nisunze imiryango yabo, bitwaje inkota zabo, amacumu n’imiheto. <verse eid="NEH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 4:14" />Mu nyuma ndaraba, ndahaguruka mbwira abakuru, abatware n’abandi bantu nti: “Ntimubatinye. Mwibuke ko Imana ikomeye kandi ihambaye, maze mugwanire benewanyu, abahungu n’abakobwa banyu, abagore banyu n’amazu yanyu.”<verse eid="NEH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 4:15" />Abansi bacu bumvise ko twamenye inama zabo kandi ko Imana yazisambuye, duca dusubira ku ruzitiro, umwe wese ku gikorwa ciwe.<verse eid="NEH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 4:16" />Kuva uwo musi, igice c’abantu banje carubaka, ikindi gice kikaba gifise amacumu, inkinzo, imiheto n’ibigwanisho. Abakuru b’ingabo na bo bagatonda inyuma y’abantu bose b’i Buyuda <verse eid="NEH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 4:17" />bariko barubaka uruzitiro. Abatwara ivyo kwubakisha bakora igikorwa cabo n’ukuboko kumwe ukundi gufise ikigwanisho, <verse eid="NEH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 4:18" />kandi umuntu wese mu bubaka yaba yambaye inkota yiwe mu mbavu agashishikara akora. Ariko uwavuza inzamba yagumana nanje.<verse eid="NEH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 4:19" />Nuko mbwira abanyacubahiro, abakuru n’abandi bantu nti: “Igikorwa ni kinini kandi kiragutse, kandi turasanzaye ku ruzitiro. <verse eid="NEH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 4:20" />Aho muza kwumvira inzamba ivuze muce mudusanga aho nyene. Imana yacu iratugwanirira!”<verse eid="NEH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 4:21" />Nuko tubandanya igikorwa igice kimwe gifise amacumu, kuva mu gitondo hatarabona neza gushika inyenyeri ziserutse. <verse eid="NEH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 4:22" />Muri ico gihe nongera mbwira abantu nti: “Umuntu wese narare i Yerusalemu ari kumwe n’umukozi wiwe, kugira ngo mw’ijoro bararire maze ku murango naho bakore.” <verse eid="NEH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 4:23" />Yaba jewe canke abo tuvukana, abantu banje canke abarinzi bari kumwe nanje, nta n’umwe yigeze akura impuzu; umwe wese yari afise ikigwanisho ciwe, no mu kuja kuvoma amazi.<verse eid="NEH 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NEH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Nehemiya afasha abakene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 5:1" />Maze abagabo n’abagore babo bidodombera benewabo b’Abayuda. <verse eid="NEH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 5:2" />Bamwe bavuga bati: “Twebwe n’abahungu bacu n’abakobwa bacu turi benshi; dukwiye kuronka ingano kugira ngo turye tubone kubaho.”<verse eid="NEH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 5:3" />Abandi bavuga bati: “Turiko turatanga ingwati y’amatongo yacu, imizabibu yacu n’amazu yacu kugira ngo turonke ingano muri iki kigoyi.”<verse eid="NEH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 5:4" />Abandi bavuga bati: “Twasavye ingurane y’amahera kugira ngo dushobore kuriha ikori ry’umwami ku matongo yacu n’imizabibu yacu. <verse eid="NEH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 5:5" />Naho dusangiye amaraso n’Abayuda benewacu n’abana bacu bakamera nk’ababo, dutegerezwa kugurisha abahungu n’abakobwa bacu ngo babe abagurano babo kugira ngo dushobore kuronka ibidutunga. Bamwe mu bakobwa bacu baramaze kuba abagurano, kandi ntitugira uko tubigenza kuko amatongo yacu n’imizabibu yacu na vyo nyene vyamaze kuba ivy’abandi.”<verse eid="NEH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 5:6" />Numvise ugutaka kwabo n’ivyo bidodomba, ndaraka cane. <verse eid="NEH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 5:7" />Ngisha inama umutima wanje, maze ntonganya abakuru n’abacamanza. Ndababwira nti: “Muriko muraguranira kuronka inyungu kuri benewanyu!” Nuko nca nkoranya ikoraniro rinini kugira ngo mvuge ivyabo <verse eid="NEH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 5:8" />maze ndavuga nti: “Twakoze uko dushoboye kwose kugira ngo tugarukane benewacu b’Abayuda bari baraguzwe n’abanyamahanga. Ubu rero ni mwebwe muriko murabagurisha kandi ngo basubire mu buja. None tuzobaguranuza kangahe?” Barahora, kuko batashobora kuronka ico bavuga.<verse eid="NEH 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 5:9" />Nuko ndabandanya nti: “Ivyo muriko murakora si vyiza. Mbega ntimwari mukwiye kugendera mu kwubaha Imana yacu kugira ngo ntimube agatwengo ku bansi bacu b’abanyamahanga? <verse eid="NEH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 5:10" />Jewe, abo tuvukana n’abantu banje twaratanze ingurane duha abantu amahera n’ingano. Ariko ntituzokwongera kubasaba inyungu y’ivyo badufitiye. <verse eid="NEH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 5:11" />Nimusubize ubu nyene amatongo, imizabibu, imyelayo n’amazu vyabo, n’inyungu yose mwabatse, ca kigira ijana c’amahera, c’ingano, c’umuvinyu n’ico amavuta.”<verse eid="NEH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 5:12" />Baravuga bati: “Turabisubiza kandi nta kindi tubasaba. Tubikora nk’uko uvuze.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:12">Nuko ntumako abaherezi n’abakuru n’abacamanza ngo barahirire imbere yabo ko bazokora ivyo basezeranye. <verse eid="NEH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 5:13" />Maze nca nkunkumura umusozo w’impuzu yanje mvuga nti: “Uku azobe ari ko Imana ikunkumura umuntu wese atazoshitsa ivyo yasezeranye, imukure mu nzu yiwe no mu vyo atunze vyose. Uko azobe ari ko umuntu nk’uyo akunkumurwa asigare ata na kimwe afise!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:13">Mvuze ivyo ikoraniro ryose riravuga riti: “Amen,” baca bahimbaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Kandi abantu bashitsa ivyo basezeranye.<verse eid="NEH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 5:14" />Vyongeye, kuva ku mwaka wa mirongo ibiri umwami Ahasuwerusi ari ku ngoma, maze kugenwa ngo mbe umukuru w’intara y’i Buyuda, kugeza ku mwaka wa mirongo itatu n’ibiri, imyaka icumi n’ibiri, yaba jewe canke abo tuvukana ntitwigeze na rimwe turya ivyagerewe umukuru w’intara. <verse eid="NEH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 5:15" />Ariko abakuru b’intara batwitangiye imbere, abatwaye imbere yanje, baremeka umutwaro uremereye abantu bakabasaba shekeli mirongo ine<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 460.</char></note> z’ifeza ziyongera ku mfungurwa n’umuvinyu. Ivyegera vyabo na vyo nyene bari bafise ivyo baremereza abantu. Ariko ku bwo kwubaha Imana sinakora nk’uko. <verse eid="NEH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 5:16" />Ahubwo, niyegurira igikorwa co ku ruzitiro. Abantu banje bose bari bakoraniye ngaho ku bwo kwubaka urwo ruzitiro; ntitwigeze tugura itongo na rimwe.<verse eid="NEH 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 5:17" />Vyongeye, Abayuda n’abakuru ijana na mirongo itanu bafungura ku meza yanje, hamwe n’abaza iwacu bavuye mu bihugu bidukikije. <verse eid="NEH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 5:18" />Ku musi, bantegurira inka imwe, intama zitandatu z’indobanurwa n’inkoko, kandi uko imisi icumi iheze ni ko bantegurira imivinyu myinshi y’ubwoko bwose. Naho vyari uko, sinigeze nsaba imfungurwa zagerewe umukuru w’intara, kuko abantu bari baremerewe n’ibikorwa.<verse eid="NEH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 5:19" />Unyibukane imbabazi zawe, yewe Mana yanje, kubera ivyo nakoreye ubu bwoko.<verse eid="NEH 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NEH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Izindi ntambara zo kubabuza kwubaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 6:1" />Sanibalati, Tobiya, Geshemu Umwarabu n’abandi bansi bacu bumvise ko nasanuye uruzitiro kandi ko ata hantu na hamwe hagisambutse, naho mu vy’ukuri ico gihe ntari bwatereko inzugi ku marembo, <verse eid="NEH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 6:2" />Sanibalati na Geshemu barungika ubutumwa buvuga ngo: “Nuze, duhurire muri kimwe mu bigwati vyo mu kiyaya c’i Ono.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 6:2">Ariko bariko barategura kungirira nabi; <verse eid="NEH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 6:3" />nuko ndungika intumwa ndabatumako nti: “Ndiko ndakora igikorwa gihambaye sinshobora kukireka ngo manuke hiyo. Ni iki cotuma mpagarika igikorwa ngo nze tubonane?” <verse eid="NEH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 6:4" />Barungika ubwo butumwa incuro zine zose, kandi igihe cose nabishura nk’uko nyene.<verse eid="NEH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 6:5" />Maze ku ncuro ya gatanu, Sanibalati arungika umukozi wiwe aza anzaniye ubwo butumwa, kandi yari afise mu ntoke ikete ritariko ikidodo <verse eid="NEH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 6:6" />ryari ryanditsemwo ngo:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NEH 6:6">“Biravugwa mu mahanga, kandi Geshemu avuga ko ari ukuri, ko wewe n’Abayuda muriko muraja inama yo kugarariza, ni co gituma muriko murubaka uruzitiro. Vyongeye, nk’uko izo nkuru zivuga, ngo ugomba kuba umwami wabo <verse eid="NEH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 6:7" />kandi ngo waramaze no gushiraho abavugishwa kugira ngo bamamaze ivyo bintu i Yerusalemu bavuga bati: ‘Hariho umwami i Buyuda!’ Ubu rero iyi nkuru izohava ishikira umwami; ni na yo mpamvu ukwiye kuza ngo duhure tubivugane.”<verse eid="NEH 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 6:8" />Ndamurungikira inyishu nti: “Nta kintu kimeze nk’ico kiriko kirakorwa; iryo ni irementanya ukuye mu mutwe wawe.”<verse eid="NEH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 6:9" />Bariko baragerageza kudutera ubwoba, bibaza bati: “Amaboko yabo azocika intege igikorwa kibananire, maze ntibagiheraheze.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 6:9">Ariko ndasenga mvuga nti: “Nkomereza amaboko.”<verse eid="NEH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 6:10" />Umusi umwe nja ku nzu ya Shemaya mwene Delaya, Delaya mwene Mehetabeli, yari yiyugaranye iwe. Maze ambwira ati: “Nuze duhurire mu Ngoro y’Imana, imbere mu rusengero, hanyuma twugare inzugi z’urusengero, kuko hariho abantu bagomba kuza kukwica. Bahenga mw’ijoro bace baza kukwica.”<verse eid="NEH 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 6:11" />Ariko ndamwishura nti: “Umugabo nkanje yohunga? Canke umuntu nkanje yoja mu Ngoro ngo akize amagara yiwe? Singenda!” <verse eid="NEH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 6:12" />Nca menya neza ko atari Imana yamutumye, ariko ko yavugishirijwe kungwanya kuko Tobiya na Sanibalati bari bamuhereye. <verse eid="NEH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 6:13" />Yari yahawe impera ngo antere ubwoba ngo nkore icaha mu gukora ivyo, na bo bace baronka ivyo bishimikiza mu kunsuzugura.<verse eid="NEH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 6:14" />Wibuke Tobiya na Sanibalati, yewe Mana yanje, ku bw’ivyo bakoze; wibuke na wa muvugishwakazi Nowadiya n’abandi bavugishwa bagerageje kuntera ubwoba.<verse eid="NEH 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Barangiza gusanura uruzitiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 6:15" />Nuko uruzitiro rurangira kwubakwa ku musi ugira mirongo ibiri na gatanu w’ukwezi kwa Eluli, tumaze imisi mirongo itanu n’ibiri turwubaka. <verse eid="NEH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 6:16" />Abansi bacu bose bavyumvise, amahanga yari adukikije agira ubwoba bacika intege, kuko bamenye ko twakoze ico gikorwa dufashijwe n’Imana yacu.<verse eid="NEH 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 6:17" />Kandi, muri iyo misi abanyacubahiro b’i Buyuda barungikira Tobiya amakete menshi, na Tobiya akabishura. <verse eid="NEH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 6:18" />Kuko benshi mu bantu b’i Buyuda bari bafitaniye amasezerano na we kuko yari umukwe wa Shekaniya mwene Ara, umuhungu wiwe na we Yehohanani akaba yari yararongoye umukobwa wa Meshulamu mwene Berekiya. <verse eid="NEH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 6:19" />Mbere baza barandatira ibikorwa vyiwe vyiza, bagaca baja kumubwira ivyo navuze vyose. Maze Tobiya agaca arungika amakete yo kuntera ubwoba.<verse eid="NEH 6:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NEH 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 7:1" />Uruzitiro rumaze gusanurwa nkamara no gutera inzugi, haciye hashirwaho abarinzi b’amarembo n’abaririmvyi n’Abalewi. <verse eid="NEH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 7:2" />Nshiraho Hanani, uwo tuvukana ngo atware i Yerusalemu, ari kumwe na Hananiya umukuru w’ingabo zo mu gisagara c’i Yerusalemu, kuko yari umuntu w’intungane kandi yubaha Imana kurusha abandi benshi. <verse eid="NEH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 7:3" />Ndababwira nti: “Amarembo y’i Yerusalemu ntaze yugururwe kugeza ku musase. Abarinzi b’amarembo bakiri ku gikorwa cabo, muze mwugare inzugi mushireko n’ibihindizo bigumya inzugi zugaye. Kandi muze mushinge ababa i Yerusalemu ngo babe abarinzi, bamwe ku birindiro vyabo abandi imbere y’amazu yabo.”<verse eid="NEH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urutonde rw’abagarutse bavuye mu kinyago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 7:4" />Muri ico gihe igisagara cari caragutse ari kinini, ariko hari abantu bake bakibamwo, kandi n’amazu ntiyari bwasanurwe. <verse eid="NEH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 7:5" />Nuko Imana yanje ishira ku mutima wanje kwegeraniriza hamwe abanyacubahiro, abakuru n’abantu bose kugira ngo biyandikishe uko imiryango yabo iri. Maze ntora igitabu canditswemwo abari baragarutse ubwa mbere. Ibi ni vyo nasanze vyanditswemwo:<verse eid="NEH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 7:6" />Uru ni rwo rutonde rw’abantu bo muri iyo ntara baduze bavuye mu kinyago abo Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni yari yarajanye nk’inyagano i Babiloni. Abo ni bo bagarutse i Yerusalemu n’i Buyuda, umwe wese aja mu gisagara c’iwabo. <verse eid="NEH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 7:7" />Bari baherekejwe na Zerubabeli, Yesuwa, Nehemiya, Azariya, Rayamiya, Nahamani, Moridekayi, Bilushani, Misipereti, Bigivayi, Nehumu na Bayana.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:7" />
  <para style="lh" vid="NEH 7:7">Urutonde rw’abagabo bo mu Bisirayeli ni uru:<verse eid="NEH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 7:8" />Abakomoka kuri Paroshi ni ibihumbi bibiri n’ijana na mirongo indwi na babiri.<verse eid="NEH 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 7:9" />Abakomoka kuri Shefatiya ni amajana atatu na mirongo indwi na babiri.<verse eid="NEH 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 7:10" />Abakomoka kuri Ara ni amajana atandatu na mirongo itanu na babiri.<verse eid="NEH 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 7:11" />Abakomoka kuri Pahati-Mowabu, biciye kuri Yesuwa na Yowabu ni ibihumbi bibiri n’amajana umunani na cumi n’umunani.<verse eid="NEH 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 7:12" />Abakomoka kuri Elamu ni igihumbi n’amajana abiri na mirongo itanu na bane.<verse eid="NEH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 7:13" />Abakomoka kuri Zatu ni amajana umunani na mirongo ine na batanu.<verse eid="NEH 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 7:14" />Abakomoka kuri Zakayi ni amajana indwi na mirongo itandatu.<verse eid="NEH 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 7:15" />Abakomoka kuri Binuwi ni amajana atandatu na mirongo ine n’umunani.<verse eid="NEH 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 7:16" />Abakomoka kuri Bebayi ni amajana atandatu na mirongo ibiri n’umunani.<verse eid="NEH 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 7:17" />Abakomoka kuri Azigadi ni ibihumbi bibiri n’amajana atatu na mirongo ibiri na babiri.<verse eid="NEH 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 7:18" />Abakomoka kuri Adonikamu ni amajana atandatu na mirongo itandatu n’indwi.<verse eid="NEH 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 7:19" />Abakomoka kuri Bigivayi ni ibihumbi bibiri na mirongo itandatu n’indwi.<verse eid="NEH 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 7:20" />Abakomoka kuri Adini ni amajana atandatu na mirongo itanu na batanu.<verse eid="NEH 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 7:21" />Abakomoka kuri Ateri, biciye kuri Hezekiya ni mirongo icenda n’umunani.<verse eid="NEH 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 7:22" />Abakomoka kuri Hashumi ni amajana atatu na mirongo ibiri n’umunani.<verse eid="NEH 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 7:23" />Abakomoka kuri Bezayi ni amajana atatu na mirongo ibiri na bane.<verse eid="NEH 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 7:24" />Abakomoka kuri Harifu ni ijana na cumi na babiri.<verse eid="NEH 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 7:25" />Abakomoka kuri Gibeyoni ni mirongo icenda na batanu.<verse eid="NEH 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 7:26" />Abantu b’i Betelehemu n’i Netofa ni ijana na mirongo umunani n’umunani.<verse eid="NEH 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 7:27" />Ab’i Anatoti ni ijana na mirongo ibiri n’umunani.<verse eid="NEH 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 7:28" />Ab’i Beti-Azimaveti ni mirongo ine na babiri.<verse eid="NEH 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 7:29" />Ab’i Kiriyati-Yeyarimu, Kefira na Beroti ni amajana indwi na mirongo ine na batatu.<verse eid="NEH 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 7:30" />Ab’i Rama n’i Geba ni amajana atandatu na mirongo ibiri n’umwe.<verse eid="NEH 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 7:31" />Ab’i Mikimashi ni ijana na mirongo ibiri na babiri.<verse eid="NEH 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 7:32" />Ab’i Beteli n’i Hayi ni ijana na mirongo ibiri na batatu.<verse eid="NEH 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 7:33" />Ab’i Nebo handi ni mirongo itanu na babiri.<verse eid="NEH 7:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 7:34" />Ab’i Elamu handi ni igihumbi n’amajana abiri na mirongo itanu na bane.<verse eid="NEH 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 7:35" />Abakomoka kuri Harimu ni amajana atatu na mirongo ibiri.<verse eid="NEH 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 7:36" />Ab’i Yeriko ni amajana atatu na mirongo ine na batanu.<verse eid="NEH 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 7:37" />Ab’i Lodi, Hadidi n’i Ono ni amajana indwi na mirongo ibiri n’umwe.<verse eid="NEH 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 7:38" />Abakomoka kuri Senaya ni ibihumbi bitatu n’amajana icenda na mirongo itatu.<verse eid="NEH 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 7:39" />Abaherezi:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:39">Abakomoka kuri Yedaya, biciye mu muryango wa Yesuwa, ni amajana icenda na mirongo indwi na batatu.<verse eid="NEH 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 7:40" />Abakomoka kuri Imeri ni igihumbi na mirongo itanu na babiri.<verse eid="NEH 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 7:41" />Abakomoka kuri Pashuri ni igihumbi n’amajana abiri na mirongo ine n’indwi.<verse eid="NEH 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 7:42" />Abakomoka kuri Harimu ni igihumbi na cumi n’indwi.<verse eid="NEH 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 7:43" />Abalewi:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:43">Abakomoka kuri Yesuwa, biciye kuri Kadimiyeli mu ruvyaro rwa Hodaviya, ni mirongo indwi na bane.<verse eid="NEH 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 7:44" />Abacuraranzi:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:44">Abakomoka kuri Asafu ni ijana na mirongo ine n’umunani.<verse eid="NEH 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 7:45" />Abarinzi b’irembo ry’urusengero:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:45">Abakomoka kuri Shalumu, Ateri, Talumoni, Akubu, Hatita na Shobayi ni ijana na mirongo itatu n’umunani.<verse eid="NEH 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 7:46" />Abakozi bo mu Ngoro:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:46">Abakomoka kuri Ziha, Hasufa, Tabawoti,<verse eid="NEH 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 7:47" />Kerosi, Siya, Padoni,<verse eid="NEH 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NEH 7:48" />Lebana, Hagaba, Shalumayi,<verse eid="NEH 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NEH 7:49" />Hanani, Gideli, Gahari,<verse eid="NEH 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NEH 7:50" />Reyaya, Rezini, Nekoda,<verse eid="NEH 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NEH 7:51" />Gazamu, Uza, Paseya,<verse eid="NEH 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NEH 7:52" />Besayi, Meyunimu, Nefusimu,<verse eid="NEH 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="NEH 7:53" />Bakibuki, Hakufa, Harihuri,<verse eid="NEH 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NEH 7:54" />Baziluti, Mehida, Harisha,<verse eid="NEH 7:54" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="NEH 7:55" />Barikosi, Sisera, Tema,<verse eid="NEH 7:55" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="NEH 7:56" />Neziya na Hatifa.<verse eid="NEH 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NEH 7:57" />Abakomoka ku bakozi ba Salomo:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:57">Abakomoka kuri</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:57">Sotayi, Sofereti, Perida,<verse eid="NEH 7:57" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="NEH 7:58" />Yayala, Darukoni, Gideli,<verse eid="NEH 7:58" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="NEH 7:59" />Shefatiya, Hatili,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:59">Pokereti-Hazebayimu na Amoni.<verse eid="NEH 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NEH 7:60" />Abakozi bo mu Ngoro n’abakomoka ku bakozi ba Salomo bose hamwe ni amajana atatu na mirongo icenda na babiri.<verse eid="NEH 7:60" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="NEH 7:61" />Aba bakurikira baduze bavuye mu bisagara vya Teli-Melahi, Teli-Harusha, Kerubi, Adoni na Imeri, ariko ntibashoboye kwerekana ko imiryango yabo ikomoka ku Bisirayeli:<verse eid="NEH 7:61" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="NEH 7:62" />Abakomoka kuri</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 7:62">Delaya, Tobiya na Nekoda ni amajana atandatu na mirongo ine na babiri.<verse eid="NEH 7:62" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NEH 7:63" />Mu baherezi:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 7:63">Abakomoka kuri Habaya, Hakozi na Baruzilayi, umugabo yari yarongoye umukobwa wa Baruzilayi Umunyagileyadi agaca yitirirwa iryo zina nyene.<verse eid="NEH 7:63" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="NEH 7:64" />Abo ni bo barondeye intonde za ba sekuruza b’imiryango yabo, ariko ntibashobora kuzironka, maze baca bakurwa mu gikorwa c’ubuherezi nk’abahumanye. <verse eid="NEH 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NEH 7:65" />Umukuru w’intara, aca abategeka kutarya ivyejejwe gushika haje umuherezi agasiguza Uhoraho akoresheje Urimu na Tumimu.<verse eid="NEH 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NEH 7:66" />Igitigiri c’abantu bose cari ibihumbi mirongo ine na bibiri n’amajana atatu na mirongo itandatu, <verse eid="NEH 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NEH 7:67" />ukuyemwo ibihumbi indwi n’amajana atatu na mirongo itatu n’indwi vy’abagurano n’abaguranokazi; kandi bari bafise abagabo n’abagore b’abaririmvyi amajana abiri na mirongo ine na batanu. <verse eid="NEH 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NEH 7:68" />Bari bafise amafarasi amajana indwi na mirongo itatu n’atandatu, indogoba amajana abiri na mirongo ine na zitanu, <verse eid="NEH 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NEH 7:69" />ingamiya amajana ane na mirongo itatu na zitanu n’indogoba ibihumbi bitandatu n’amajana indwi na mirongo ibiri.<verse eid="NEH 7:69" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="NEH 7:70" />Bamwe mu bakuru b’imiryango barafashije muri ico gikorwa. Umukuru w’intara atanga mu bubiko ingero dariki igihumbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:70 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 8,4.</char></note> z’inzahabu, ibikombe mirongo itanu n’impuzu amajana atanu na mirongo itatu z’abaherezi. <verse eid="NEH 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NEH 7:71" />Bamwe bo mu bakuru b’imiryango batanga mu bubiko bw’ico gikorwa ingero dariki ibihumbi mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:71 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 170.</char></note> z’inzahabu n’ingero mina ibihumbi bibiri n’amajana abiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:71 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’itoni 1,3.</char></note> z’ifeza. <verse eid="NEH 7:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="NEH 7:72" />Ivyatanzwe n’abantu basigaye vyose hamwe zari ingero dariki ibihumbi mirongo ibiri z’inzahabu, ingero mina ibihumbi bibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:72 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’itoni 1,2.</char></note> z’ifeza n’impuzu mirongo itandatu n’indwi z’abaherezi.<verse eid="NEH 7:72" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="NEH 7:73" />Abaherezi, Abalewi, abarinzi b’irembo, abaririmvyi n’abakozi bo mu Ngoro, bari kumwe n’abandi bantu hamwe n’Abisirayeli bose baja kuba mu bisagara vyabo.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="NEH 7:73">Ezira asoma ivyagezwe</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:73">Kandi ukwezi kw’indwi kwashitse Abisirayeli bamaze kuja mu bisagara vyabo.<verse eid="NEH 7:73" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NEH 8" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 8:1" />Maze abantu bose bakoranira hamwe nk’umuntu umwe mu kibuga kiri imbere y’Irembo ry’Amazi. Babwira Ezira umwigisha w’Ivyanditswe ngo asohore Igitabu c’Ivyagezwe vya Mose, ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarahaye Abisirayeli.<verse eid="NEH 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 8:2" />Maze ku musi wa mbere w’ukwezi kw’indwi Ezira umuherezi azana Ivyagezwe imbere y’ikoraniro, ryari rigizwe n’abagabo n’abagore bashobora gutahura. <verse eid="NEH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 8:3" />Abisoma n’ijwi rirenga uhereye mu gitondo gushika ku murango atumbereye ku kibuga c’imbere y’Irembo ry’Amazi imbere y’abagabo, abagore n’abandi bashobora gutahura kandi abantu bose bumviriza batekereje ivyo mu gitabu c’Ivyagezwe.<verse eid="NEH 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 8:4" />Ezira umunyabwenge w’Ivyanditswe ahagarara ahatamuratse hubatswe mu biti ku bwo ico gikorwa. I ruhande yiwe i buryo hari hahagaze Matitiya, Shema, Anaya, Uriya, Hilikiya na Mayaseya; i bubampfu bwiwe hari Pedaya, Mishayeli, Malikiya, Hashumi, Hashibadana, Zakariya na Meshulamu.<verse eid="NEH 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 8:5" />Ezira azingurura ca gitabu. Abantu bose bashobora kumubona kuko yari ahagaza ahataramutse; amaze kukizingurura, abantu bose barahaguruka. <verse eid="NEH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 8:6" />Ezira ahimbaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ihambaye; maze abantu bose baduza amaboko barishura bati: “Amen! Amen!” Baca barunama basenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bubamye hasi.<verse eid="NEH 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 8:7" />Abalewi ari bo Yesuwa, Bani, Sherebiya, Yamini, Akubu, Shabetayi, Hodiya, Mayaseya, Kelita, Azariya, Yozabadi, Hanani na Pelaya, bigisha abantu ivyo mu Vyagezwe abantu bagihagaze ngaho. <verse eid="NEH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 8:8" />Basoma mu Gitabu c’Ivyagezwe vy’Imana, barabitomora, babiha n’insiguro kugira ngo abantu bashobore gutahura ivyariko birasomwa.<verse eid="NEH 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 8:9" />Nuko Nehemiya umukuru w’intara, Ezira umuherezi n’umwigisha w’ivyagezwe, n’Abalewi bariko barigisha abantu bababwira bose bati: “Uyu musi ni Uwera k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. Ntimugandare canke ngo murire.” Kuko abantu bose bariko bararira uko bumviriza amajambo yo mu Vyagezwe.<verse eid="NEH 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 8:10" />Nehemiya aravuga ati: “Nimugende murye ibiryoshe munywe n’ibinyobwa bisosa, kandi murungikire n’abatateguye na kimwe. Uwu musi ni uwera k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu. Ntimubabare, kuko umunezero w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari wo nkomezi zanyu.”<verse eid="NEH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 8:11" />Abalewi bamama abantu bose, bavuga bati: “Nimutekereze, kuko uwu ari umusi wera. Ntimubabare.”<verse eid="NEH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 8:12" />Nuko abantu bose baca bagenda kurya no kunywa, no kurungikiranira ivyokurya no guhimbaza banezerewe cane, kuko bari batahuye amajambo bari bamenyeshejwe.<verse eid="NEH 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 8:13" />Ku musi wa kabiri w’uko kwezi, abakuru b’imiryango, bari kumwe n’abaherezi n’Abalewi, bakoranira aho umwigisha w’Ivyagezwe Ezira ari, kugira ngo bumvirize neza amajambo yo mu Vyagezwe. <verse eid="NEH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 8:14" />Basanga mu Vyagezwe, ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yaratanze acishije kuri Mose, handitse ngo Abisirayeli baze babe mu nsago bagire umusi mukuru wo mu kwezi kw’indwi <verse eid="NEH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 8:15" />kandi ko bari bakwiye kwamamaza iryo jambo bakarikwiragiza mu bisagara vyabo n’i Yerusalemu ngo: “Nimusohoke muduge mu ntara y’imisozi maze muzane amashami mwakuye ku biti vy’imyelayo yo mu mirima hamwe n’ibiti vy’imyelayo yo mw’ishamba, no ku miriteli, ku bigazi no ku biti vyose bizitanye, kugira ngo mwubake insago nk’uko vyanditswe.”<verse eid="NEH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 8:16" />Nuko abantu barasohoka bazana amashami biyubakira utuzu dutoduto imbere y’inzu zabo, mu ngo zabo, imbere y’Ingoro y’Imana no ku kibuga kiri i ruhande y’Irembo ry’Amazi n’ikiri i ruhande y’Irembo rya Efurayimu. <verse eid="NEH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 8:17" />Abantu bose bari baravuye mu kinyago bubaka insago bazibamwo. Kuva mu gihe ca Yesuwa mwene Nuni gushika uwo musi, Abisirayeli ntibari bwahimbaze uwo musi mukuru nk’uko. Maze baranezerwa cane.<verse eid="NEH 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 8:18" />Uko umusi utashe, uhereye ku musi wa mbere gushika ku wa nyuma, Ezira yama abasomera ico Gitabu c’Ivyagezwe vy’Imana; bagahimbaza uwo musi mukuru imisi indwi, maze ku musi w’umunani hakaba ikoraniro rinini nk’uko vyari bitegekanijwe.<verse eid="NEH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NEH 9" />
  <para style="s1">Abisirayeli batura ivyaha vyabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 9:1" />Ku musi wa mirongo ibiri na kane w’ukwo kwezi nyene, Abisirayeli bakoranira hamwe, bisonzesheje, bambaye amagunira bisuriyeko umukungugu ku mitwe. <verse eid="NEH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 9:2" />Abakomoka kuri Isirayeli bose bari bitandukanije n’abanyamahanga bose. Bahagarara mu bibanza vyabo batura ivyaha vyabo n’ibibi vyose ba sekuruza bari barakoze. <verse eid="NEH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 9:3" />Bahagarara aho bari bari maze basoma mu Gitabu c’Ivyagezwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo amasaha atandatu, bongera bamara ayandi masaha atandatu batura ivyaha vyabo basenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo. <verse eid="NEH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 9:4" />Abalewi bari bahagaze ku ngazi: Yesuwa, Bani, Kadimiyeli, Shebaniya, Buni, Sherebiya, Bani na Kenani, bambaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo n’ijwi rirenga. <verse eid="NEH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 9:5" />Kandi Abalewi ari bo Yesuwa, Kadimiyeli, Bani, Hashabuneya, Sherebiya, Hodiya, Shebaniya na Petahiya, baravuga bati: “Nimuhaguruke muhimbaze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu, yamyeho kandi izokwamaho.” Barasenga bati:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NEH 9:5">“Izina ryawe ry’icubahiro riragahezagirwa, kandi rishirwe hejuru y’imihezagiro yose no guhimbazwa kwose. <verse eid="NEH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 9:6" />Ni wewe wenyene <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Waremye amajuru, mbere n’amajuru asumba ayandi, n’inyenyeri zose, isi n’ibiyuzuye, ibiyaga n’ibiri muri vyo. Ni wewe utanga ubuzima ku bintu vyose, kandi ingabo zo mw’ijuru ziragusenga.<verse eid="NEH 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 9:7" />Ni wewe wenyene <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana, watoranije Aburamu umukura muri Uri mu Bukaludaya maze umwita Aburahamu. <verse eid="NEH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 9:8" />Wabonye ko umutima wiwe ukuyoboka, uca ugirana isezerano na we ngo uze uhe uruvyaro rwiwe igihugu c’Abanyakanani, Abaheti, Abamori, Abaperizi, Abayebusi n’Abagirugashi. Wakomeje isezerano ryawe kuko ugororoka.<verse eid="NEH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 9:9" />Wabonye imibabaro ba sogokuruza barimwo muri Egiputa; wumvise ugutaka kwabo bari ku Kiyaga Gitukura. <verse eid="NEH 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 9:10" />Weretse ibimenyetso n’ibitangaza Farawo, ku bakuru no ku bantu bose bo mu gihugu ciwe, kuko wari uzi ingene Abanyegiputa babatwaza amanyama. Wabaye rurangiranwa, kandi n’ubu uracari rurangiranwa. <verse eid="NEH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 9:11" />Waciyemwo kubiri Ikiyaga Gitukura imbere yabo, kugira ngo barengane muri co baca ahumutse, ariko ababakurikira amazi yarabarengeye, nk’uko ibuye ryibira mu mupfunda w’amazi. <verse eid="NEH 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 9:12" />Ku murango wabarongoza inkingi y’igicu, maze mw’ijoro ukabarongoza inkingi y’umuriro ngo ubamurikire mu nzira bacamwo.<verse eid="NEH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 9:13" />Waje uvuye ku musozi Sinayi; wavuganye na bo uri mw’ijuru. Wabahaye ibibagenga n’ivyagezwe bitunganye, amabwirizwa n’amategeko meza. <verse eid="NEH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 9:14" />Wabamenyesheje ivy’Isabato yawe yera maze ubaha amategeko, amabwirizwa, n’ivyagezwe ubicishije ku musavyi wawe Mose. <verse eid="NEH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 9:15" />Igihe bari bashonje wabahaye ivyokurya bivuye mw’ijuru n’igihe bari banyotewe wabahaye amazi avuye mu gitandara. Wabategetse kwinjira no kwegukira igihugu wari wararahiye umanitse ukuboko ko uzokibaha.<verse eid="NEH 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 9:16" />Ariko ba sogokuruza bagira amanyama baragarariza, maze ntibitondera ivyo wategetse. <verse eid="NEH 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 9:17" />Banka kwumva bibananira no kwibuka ibitangaza wakoreye muri bo. Baragarariza, maze bishingira uwo kubarongora ngo basubire mu buja bwabo. Ariko uri Imana iharira, uri inyabuntu igira imbabazi, iteba kuraka kandi y’urukundo rwinshi. Ni co catumye utabaheba, <verse eid="NEH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 9:18" />no mu gihe bibumbira igishushanyo c’ishuri bakavuga bati: ‘Iyi ni yo mana yanyu, yabakuye muri Egiputa,’ canke igihe bakurogotako bakagutuka.<verse eid="NEH 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 9:19" />Kubera imbabazi zawe nyinshi ntiwabahebeye mu bugaragwa. Ku murango inkingi y’igicu ntiyaretse kubarongora mu nzira yabo, canke inkingi y’umuriro mw’ijoro ngo ireke kubamurikira mu nzira yabo bajana. <verse eid="NEH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 9:20" />Wabahaye Mpwemu wawe mwiza ngo abahe gutahura. Ntiwabimye manu ngo babure ico barya, kandi wabahaye n’amazi abamara inyota. <verse eid="NEH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 9:21" />Mu myaka mirongo ine yose warabashigikiye mu bugaragwa; nta co bigeze bakena, impuzu zabo ntizigeze zishira canke ngo ibirenge vyabo bivyimbe.<verse eid="NEH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 9:22" />Wagabuye mu maboko yabo ubwami n’amahanga, kugira ngo ubahe n’intara zari zikikije ico gihugu cabo. Bigaruriye igihugu ca Sihoni umwami w’i Heshiboni n’igihugu ca Ogi umwami w’i Bashani. <verse eid="NEH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 9:23" />Wagwije abahungu babo bangana n’inyenyeri zo kw’ijuru, maze ubazana mu gihugu wari warabwiye ba sekuruza ko bazocinjira kikaba icabo bwite. <verse eid="NEH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 9:24" />Abahungu babo baracinjiye kiba icabo bwite. Wirukanye Abanyakanani imbere yabo, baba muri ico gihugu; wagabuye Abanyakanani mu maboko yabo, hamwe n’abami babo n’abantu baba muri ico gihugu, ngo babakoreshe ico bashaka. <verse eid="NEH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 9:25" />Bigaruriye ibisagara bizitijwe inzitiro n’amatongo yimbuka; bigaruriye amazu yuzuye ivyiza vyinshi vy’uburyo bwinshi, amariba yimbwe, imizabibu, imyelayo n’ibiti vy’ivyamwa vyinshi cane. Bararya barahaga maze baravyibuha; banezererwa ivyiza wabahaye.<verse eid="NEH 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 9:26" />Ariko ntibumvira barakugarariza; batera ibitugu Ivyagezwe vyawe, bica abavugishwa nawe, bari babatumweko ngo baguhindukirire bakugarukeko; bakora ivyo kukurogotako bisesema. <verse eid="NEH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 9:27" />Ni co catumye ubagabura mu maboko y’abansi babo, barabacinyiza. Ariko bamaze gucinyizwa baragutakira. Ubumva uri mw’ijuru, maze ku bw’imbabazi zawe nyinshi ubarungikira abo kubakiza, babarokora mu maboko y’abansi babo.<verse eid="NEH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 9:28" />Ariko bamaze kudibama, basubira gukora ibibi mu nyonga zawe. Uca ubarekurira mu maboko y’abansi babo ngo babaganze. Maze bagutakambiye kandi, ubumva uri mw’ijuru, kubera imbabazi zawe urongera urabatabara kandi ubikora wikurikiranya kenshi.<verse eid="NEH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 9:29" />Urabinginga ngo bahindukirire ivyagezwe vyawe, ariko bagira amanyama ntibumvira amabwirizwa yawe. Bacumura ku mategeko yawe kandi ari yo azobeshaho umuntu ayumvira. Bakomantaza imitima, maze barahindukira baguha umugongo, baragarariza banka kwumva. <verse eid="NEH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 9:30" />Wabihanganiye imyaka myinshi. Wababuriye ubicishije muri Mpwemu wawe yari mu bavugishwa nawe. Ariko ntibavyitayeho, ni co catumye ubarekurira mu maboko y’amahanga yari abakikije. <verse eid="NEH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 9:31" />Ariko kubera imbabazi zawe nyinshi ntiwabaherengeteje canke ngo ubahebe, kuko uri Imana y’inyabuntu kandi y’inyembabazi.<verse eid="NEH 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 9:32" />None rero, Mana yacu, Mana nkuru, y’inyenkomezi kandi ihambaye, izigama isezerano ry’urukundo, ntiwirengagize ibi bihe bigoye vyadushitseko, n’abami bacu n’abarongozi bacu, ku baherezi bacu no ku bavugishwa n’Imana bacu, kuri ba sogokuruza no ku bantu bose, kuva mu gihe c’abami b’i Ashuri gushika uwu musi. <verse eid="NEH 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 9:33" />Mu vyatubayeko vyose, wamye uri uwugororotse; wakoze mu bwizigirwa, ariko tweho twakoze ibibi. <verse eid="NEH 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 9:34" />Abami bacu, abaturongora, abaherezi bacu na ba sogokuruza ntibitondeye Ivyagezwe vyawe; ntibashize umutima ku mabwirizwa yawe canke ku mburi wabarungikiye. <verse eid="NEH 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 9:35" />No mu gihe bari bakiri mu bwami bwabo, bakinezererwa ukugira neza kwawe kwari kuri bo bakiri mu gihugu kinini kandi cimbuka wabahaye, ntibagukorera canke ngo bahindukire bave mu nzira zabo mbi.<verse eid="NEH 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 9:36" />Ariko raba, uwu musi turi abagurano, abagurano mu gihugu wahaye ba sogokuruza kugira ngo barye ivyamwa n’ibindi vyiza cimbuka. <verse eid="NEH 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 9:37" />Kubera ivyaha vyacu, ivyimburwa vyaco vyinshi bija ku bami waduhaye ngo batuganze. Ni bo batuganza twe n’amasho yacu uko bishakiye. Natwe turi mu gahinda kenshi.<verse eid="NEH 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abantu bagira amasezerano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 9:38" />Ku bw’ivyo, turasezeranye isezerano kandi tuzoryandika, kandi abarongozi bacu, Abalewi bacu n’abaherezi bacu bashireko amazina yabo n’ibidodo vyabo.”<verse eid="NEH 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NEH 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 10:1" />Abashizeko ibidodo vyabo ni:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 10:1" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 10:1">Umukuru w’intara:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 10:1">Nehemiya mwene Hakaliya.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 10:1" />
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 10:1">Zedekiya, <verse eid="NEH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 10:2" />Seraya, Azariya, Yeremiya,<verse eid="NEH 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 10:3" />Pashuri, Amariya, Malikiya,<verse eid="NEH 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 10:4" />Hatushi, Shebaniya, Maluki,<verse eid="NEH 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 10:5" />Harimu, Meremoti, Obadiya,<verse eid="NEH 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 10:6" />Daniyeli, Ginetoni, Baruki,<verse eid="NEH 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 10:7" />Meshulamu, Abiya, Miyamini,<verse eid="NEH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 10:8" />Mayaziya, Bilugayi na Shemaya.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 10:8">Abo bari abaherezi.<verse eid="NEH 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 10:9" />Abalewi:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 10:9">Yesuwa mwene Azaniya, Binuwi wo mu bahungu ba Henadadi, Kadimiyeli,<verse eid="NEH 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 10:10" />n’abo bari bafatanije: Shebaniya,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 10:10">Hodiya, Kelita, Pelaya, Hanani,<verse eid="NEH 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 10:11" />Mika, Rehobu, Hashabiya,<verse eid="NEH 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 10:12" />Zakuri, Sherebiya, Shebaniya,<verse eid="NEH 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 10:13" />Hodiya, Bani na Beninu.<verse eid="NEH 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 10:14" />Abarongora abantu:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 10:14">Paroshi, Pahati-Mowabu, Elamu, Zatu, Bani,<verse eid="NEH 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 10:15" />Buni, Azigadi, Bebayi,<verse eid="NEH 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 10:16" />Adoniya, Bigivayi, Adini,<verse eid="NEH 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 10:17" />Ateri, Hezekiya, Azuri,<verse eid="NEH 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 10:18" />Hodiya, Hashumi, Bezayi,<verse eid="NEH 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 10:19" />Harifu, Anatoti, Nebayi,<verse eid="NEH 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 10:20" />Magipiyashi, Meshulamu, Heziri,<verse eid="NEH 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 10:21" />Meshezabeli, Zadoki, Yaduwa,<verse eid="NEH 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 10:22" />Pelatiya, Hanani, Anaya,<verse eid="NEH 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 10:23" />Hoseya, Hananiya, Hashubi,<verse eid="NEH 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 10:24" />Haloheshi, Piliha, Shobeki,<verse eid="NEH 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 10:25" />Rehumu, Hashabuna, Mayaseya,<verse eid="NEH 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 10:26" />Ahiya, Hanani, Anani,<verse eid="NEH 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 10:27" />Maluki, Harimu na Bayana.<verse eid="NEH 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 10:28" />Abasigaye bo mu bantu, abaherezi, Abalewi, abarinzi b’amarembo, abaririmvyi, abakozi bo mu Ngoro hamwe n’abantu bose bitandukanije n’ababanyi babo b’abanyamahanga ku bwo kwumvira Ivyagezwe vy’Imana, hamwe rero n’abagore babo n’abahungu n’abakobwa babo bose bashobora gutahura, <verse eid="NEH 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 10:29" />abo bose bifatanya na benewabo b’abanyacubahiro, maze bararahira ko bazokurikiza Ivyagezwe vy’Imana vyatanzwe biciye kuri Mose umusavyi w’Imana no kwitondera amabwirizwa, amategeko n’ivyashinzwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu.<verse eid="NEH 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 10:30" />Dusezeranye kudashingira abakobwa bacu ku banyamahanga tubana canke ngo abahungu bacu batware abakobwa babo.<verse eid="NEH 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 10:31" />Igihe abanyamahanga tubana bazoba bazanye ibidandazwa canke ingano kugurisha kw’Isabato canke ku wundi musi mukuru wose, ntituzobagurira. Mu mwaka ugira indwi wose ntituzoja kurima kandi tuzohebera abantu amadeni yose badufitiye.<verse eid="NEH 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 10:32" />“Twiyemeje ko tuzoshishikara gushira mu ngiro icagezwe co gutanga uko umwaka uheze ica gatatu ca shekeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 4.</char></note> co gushigikira igikorwa co mu Ngoro y’Imana yacu: <verse eid="NEH 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 10:33" />kugira ngo ya mikate yo gushira ku meza, vya bimazi vy’ifu n’ibimazi vyo guturirwa n’umuriro vyama bitangwa ku musi, vya bimazi vyo ku masabato, ya misi mikuru y’imboneko z’ukwezi n’imisi mikuru yategekanijwe, vya bimazi vyera, n’ivy’ivyaha vyo guhongera Abisirayeli, hamwe n’ibikorwa vyose vyo mu Ngoro y’Imana yacu bishobore gukorwa neza.<verse eid="NEH 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 10:34" />Twebwe abaherezi, Abalewi n’abantu basanzwe twagize ubupfindo kugira ngo tumenye igihe umuryango wose uzozana mu Ngoro y’Imana yacu mu bihe vyashinzwe vyo ku mwaka, inkwi zitegekanijwe zo gucana ku gicaniro c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu, nk’uko vyanditswe mu Vyagezwe.<verse eid="NEH 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 10:35" />Twiyemeje kandi kuzana mu Ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uko umwaka uheze ivyeze imbere y’ibindi mu vyimburwa n’ivyo ku biti vy’ivyamwa.<verse eid="NEH 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 10:36" />Kandi nk’uko vyanditswe mu Vyagezwe, tuzozana imfura zacu z’abahungu n’izavutse ubwa mbere mu nka zacu, no mu mikuku yacu mu Ngoro y’Imana yacu, tubishikirize abaherezi bakorayo.<verse eid="NEH 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 10:37" />Vyongeye, tuzozana mu bubiko bw’Ingoro y’Imana yacu, dushikirize abaherezi, ivyeze imbere y’ibindi mu mirima, ivyo mu mashikanwa y’ifu, y’ivyamwa vy’ibiti vyacu n’umutobe w’umuvinyu wacu n’amavuta. Kandi tuzozana ikigiracumi c’ivyo twimbuye tugihe Abalewi, kuko Abalewi ari bo begeranya ibigiracumi mu bisagara vyose aho dukorera. <verse eid="NEH 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 10:38" />Umuherezi akomoka kuri Aroni ni we azoherekeza Abalewi mu gihe bazokwakira ibigiracumi, maze Abalewi bazozana ica cumi c’ibigiracumi bakiriye mu vyumba vy’ububiko bw’ubutunzi bw’Ingoro y’Imana yacu. <verse eid="NEH 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 10:39" />Abisirayeli, harimwo n’Abalewi, bazozana amashikanwa yabo y’ingano, umutobe mushasha w’umuvinyu n’amavuta, mu vyumba bibikwamwo ibikoresho vy’ahera hafi y’aho abaherezi, abarinzi b’irembo n’abaririmvyi bakorera.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NEH 10:39">Ntituzofata minenerwe Ingoro y’Imana yacu.”<verse eid="NEH 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NEH 11" />
  <para style="s1">Abandi baje kuba i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 11:1" />Maze abarongoye abantu baja kuba i Yerusalemu. Ku bandi bantu habanza kugirwa ubupfindo, ngo bamenye umuryango umwe ku miryango icumi uja kuba i Yerusalemu, igisagara cera. Iyo miryango icenda isigaye bategerezwa kuguma mu bisagara vyabo. <verse eid="NEH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 11:2" />Abantu bahezagira cane abemeye ku gushaka kwabo kuja kuba i Yerusalemu.<verse eid="NEH 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 11:3" />Aba ni bo batware bari barongoye intara bimukiye i Yerusalemu. Muri ico gihe Abisirayeli benshi, abaherezi, Abalewi, abakozi bo mu Ngoro n’abakomoka ku bakozi ba Salomo baba mu bisagara bitandukanye vy’i Buyuda, umwe wese mw’itongo ryiwe, <verse eid="NEH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 11:4" />ariko abantu bamwe bo mu Bayuda no mu Babenyamini bashima kuba i Yerusalemu:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 11:4" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 11:4">Abakomoka kuri Yuda ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:4">Ataya mwene Uziya, Uziya mwene Zakariya, Zakariya mwene Amariya, Amariya mwene Shefatiya, Shefatiya mwene Mahalaleli, Mahalaleli wo mu ruvyaro rwa Perezi,<verse eid="NEH 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 11:5" />hamwe na Mayaseya mwene Baruki, Baruki mwene Koli-Hoze, Koli-Hoze mwene Hazaya, Hazaya mwene Adaya, Adaya mwene Yoyaribu, Yoyaribu mwene Zakariya, Zakariya akomoka kuri Shela.<verse eid="NEH 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 11:6" />Abakomoka kuri Perezi baba i Yerusalemu bashika amajana ane na mirongo itandatu n’umunani, abagabo b’intwari babushitse.<verse eid="NEH 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 11:7" />Mu bakomoka kuri Benyamini ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:7">Salu mwene Meshulamu, Meshulamu mwene Yowedi, Yowedi mwene Pedaya, Pedaya mwene Kolaya, Kolaya mwene Mayaseya, Mayaseya mwene Itiyeli, Itiyeli mwene Yeshaya, <verse eid="NEH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 11:8" />n’abamukurikira, Gabayi na Salayi. Bose hamwe ni abagabo amajana icenda na mirongo ibiri n’umunani.<verse eid="NEH 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 11:9" />Yoweli mwene Zikuri yari umukuru w’ingabo mukuru wabo, na Yuda mwene Hasenuwa yatwara akarere ka kabiri k’igisagara.<verse eid="NEH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 11:10" />Mu bakomoka ku baherezi ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:10">Yedaya mwene Yoyaribu, Yakini,<verse eid="NEH 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 11:11" />Seraya mwene Hilukiya, Hilukiya mwene Meshulamu, Meshulamu mwene Sadoki, Sadoki mwene Merayoti, Merayoti mwene Ahitubu, Ahitubu uwari ajejwe ivyo mu Ngoro y’Imana, <verse eid="NEH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 11:12" />n’abo bari bafatanije, bashishikara igikorwa co mu Ngoro, bari abagabo amajana umunani na mirongo ibiri na babiri.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:12">Adaya mwene Yerohamu, Yerohamu mwene Pelaliya, Pelaliya mwene Amuzi, Amuzi mwene Zakariya, Zakariya mwene Pashuri, Pashuri mwene Malikiya, <verse eid="NEH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 11:13" />n’abo bari bafatanije, bari abakuru b’imiryango, bari abagabo amajana abiri na mirongo ine na babiri.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:13">Amashisayi mwene Azareli, Azareli mwene Ahizayi, Ahizayi mwene Meshilemoti, Meshilemoti mwene Imeri, <verse eid="NEH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 11:14" />n’abo bari bafatanije, bari abagabo b’intwari, ijana na mirongo ibiri n’umunani.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:14">Umukuru w’ingabo yari Zabudiyeli mwene Hagedolimu.<verse eid="NEH 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 11:15" />Abakomoka ku Balewi ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:15">Shemaya mwene Hashubi, Hashubi mwene Azirikamu, Azirikamu mwene Hashabiya, Hashabiya mwene Buni,<verse eid="NEH 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 11:16" />Shabetayi na Yozabadi, babiri bo mu bakuru b’Abalewi, bari bajejwe ibikorwa vyo hanze y’Ingoro y’Imana;<verse eid="NEH 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 11:17" />Mataniya mwene Mika, Mika mwene Zabudi, Zabudi mwene Asafu, Asafu umurongozi yarongora ibikorwa vyo gushimira Imana no gusenga;</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:17">Bakibukiya, uwa kabiri mu bari bafatanije na we,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:17">na Abuda mwene Shamuwa, Shamuwa mwene Galali, Galali mwene Yedutuni.<verse eid="NEH 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 11:18" />Abalewi bo mu gisagara cera bashika amajana abiri na mirongo umunani na bane.<verse eid="NEH 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 11:19" />Abarinzi b’irembo ni:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="NEH 11:19">Akubu, Talumoni n’abo bari bafatanije, baguma barinze amarembo, bari abagabo ijana na mirongo indwi na babiri.<verse eid="NEH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 11:20" />Abandi Bisirayeli basigaye, hamwe n’abaherezi n’Abalewi, baba mu bisagara vyose vy’i Buyuda, umwe wese mw’itongo rya ba sekuruza.<verse eid="NEH 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 11:21" />Abakozi bo mu Ngoro baba ku musozi wa Ofeli, kandi Ziha na Gishupa ni bo bari babarongoye.<verse eid="NEH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 11:22" />Umukuru w’Abalewi i Yerusalemu yari Uzi mwene Bani, Bani mwene Hashabiya, Hashabiya mwene Mataniya, Mataniya mwene Mika. Uzi yari umwe mu bakomotse kuri Asafu, bari abaririmvyi bajejwe igikorwa co mu Ngoro y’Imana. <verse eid="NEH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 11:23" />Abaririmvyi bategekwa n’umwami, ni we yagena ivyo bakora ku musi ku musi.<verse eid="NEH 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 11:24" />Petahiya mwene Meshezabeli, umwe mu bakomotse kuri Zera mwene Yuda, yari umukozi w’umwami mu bikorwa vyose vyerekeye kurongora abantu.<verse eid="NEH 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 11:25" />Ku bijanye n’ibigwati n’imirima yavyo, bamwe mu bantu b’i Buyuda baba i Kiriyati-Araba no mu bigwati bihakikije, i Diboni no mu bigwati vyaho, i Yekabuzeyeli no mu bigwati vyaho, <verse eid="NEH 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 11:26" />i Yesuwa, i Molada, i Beti-Peleti, <verse eid="NEH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 11:27" />i Hazari-Shuwali, i Berisheba no mu bigwati vyaho, <verse eid="NEH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 11:28" />i Zikulagi, i Mekona no mu bigwati vyaho, <verse eid="NEH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 11:29" />i Eni-Rimoni, i Zora, i Yarimuti, <verse eid="NEH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 11:30" />i Zanowa, muri Adulamu no mu bigwati vyaho, i Lakishi no mu mirima yaho, n’i Azeka no mu bigwati vyaho. Nuko baba ngaho uhereye i Berisheba gushika mu kiyaya ca Hinomu.<verse eid="NEH 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 11:31" />Abakomoka ku Babenyamini kuva i Geba baba i Mikimashi, Ayiya, Beteli n’ibigwati vyaho, <verse eid="NEH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 11:32" />i Anatoti, Nobu n’i Ananiya, <verse eid="NEH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 11:33" />i Hazori, i Rama n’i Gitayimu, <verse eid="NEH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 11:34" />i Hadidi, i Zeboyimu n’i Nebalati, <verse eid="NEH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 11:35" />i Lodi n’i Ono, no mu kiyaya c’abanyamyuga.<verse eid="NEH 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 11:36" />Imwe mu mice y’Abalewi b’i Buyuda baba i Bubenyamini.<verse eid="NEH 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NEH 12" />
  <para style="s1">Abaherezi n’Abalewi</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 12:1" />Aba ni bo bari abaherezi n’Abalewi bagarutse bari kumwe na Zerubabeli mwene Sheyalutiyeli ari kumwe na Yesuwa:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 12:1" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:1">Seraya, Yeremiya, Ezira,<verse eid="NEH 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 12:2" />Amariya, Maluki, Hatushi,<verse eid="NEH 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 12:3" />Shekaniya, Rehumu, Meremoti,<verse eid="NEH 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 12:4" />Ido, Ginetoni, Abiya,<verse eid="NEH 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 12:5" />Miyamini, Mowadiya, Biluga,<verse eid="NEH 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 12:6" />Shemaya, Yoyaribu, Yedaya,<verse eid="NEH 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 12:7" />Salu, Amoki, Hilikiya na Yedaya.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 12:7" />
  <para style="lf" vid="NEH 12:7">Abo ni bo bari abarongozi b’abaherezi n’abo bari bafatanije mu misi ya Yesuwa.<verse eid="NEH 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 12:8" />Abalewi bari Yesuwa, Binuwi, Kadimiyeli, Sherebiya, Yuda na Mataniya, uwari ajejwe indirimbo z’ishimwe, hamwe n’abo bari bafatanije. <verse eid="NEH 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 12:9" />Bakibukiya na Uni, abo bari bafatanije, bahagarara barabana na bo mu gihe c’ibikorwa.<verse eid="NEH 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 12:10" />Yesuwa yari se wa Yoyakimu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:10">Yoyakimu se wa Eliyashibu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:10">Eliyashibu se wa Yoyada,<verse eid="NEH 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 12:11" />Yoyada se wa Yonatani,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:11">Yonatani na we akaba se wa Yaduwa.<verse eid="NEH 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 12:12" />Mu misi ya Yoyakimu, aba ni bo bari abakuru b’imiryango y’abaherezi:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 12:12" />
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:12">Mu muryango wa Seraya ni Meraya.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:12">Mu muryango wa Yeremiya ni Hananiya.<verse eid="NEH 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 12:13" />Mu muryango wa Ezira ni Meshulamu.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:13">Mu muryango wa Amariya ni Yehohanani.<verse eid="NEH 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 12:14" />Mu muryango wa Maluki ni Yonatani.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:14">Mu muryango wa Shebaniya ni Yosefu.<verse eid="NEH 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 12:15" />Mu muryango wa Harimu ni Adina.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:15">Mu muryango wa Meremoti ni Helukayi.<verse eid="NEH 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 12:16" />Mu muryango wa Ido ni Zakariya.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:16">Mu muryango wa Ginetoni ni Meshulamu.<verse eid="NEH 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 12:17" />Mu muryango wa Abiya ni Zikuri.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:17">Mu muryango wa Miniyamini no mu muryango wa Mowadiya ni Pilutayi.<verse eid="NEH 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 12:18" />Mu muryango wa Biluga ni Shamuwa.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:18">Mu muryango wa Shemaya ni Yehonatani.<verse eid="NEH 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 12:19" />Mu muryango wa Yoyaribu ni Matenayi.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:19">Mu muryango wa Yedaya ni Uzi.<verse eid="NEH 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 12:20" />Mu muryango wa Salu ni Kalayi.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:20">Mu muryango wa Amoki ni Eberi.<verse eid="NEH 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 12:21" />Mu muryango wa Hilikiya ni Hashabiya.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="NEH 12:21">Mu muryango wa Yedaya ni Netaneli.<verse eid="NEH 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 12:22" />Abakuru b’imiryango y’Abalewi mu misi ya Eliyashibu, Yoyada, Yohanani na Yaduwa, hamwe n’abo mu baherezi, bari banditswe mu bitabu ku ngoma ya Dariyusi Umuperesi. <verse eid="NEH 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 12:23" />Abakuru b’imiryango mu bakomoka kuri Lewi kugeza mu gihe ca Yohanani mwene Eliyashibu bari banditswe mu gitabu c’ibigenda biraba. <verse eid="NEH 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 12:24" />Kandi abarongozi bo mu Balewi bari Hashabiya, Sherebiya, Yesuwa mwene Kadimiyeli, n’abo bari bafatanije, bahagarara barabana na bo ngo bahimbaze batange n’ishimwe, umugwi ukagomborwa n’uwundi, nk’uko vyashinzwe na Dawidi umuntu w’Imana.<verse eid="NEH 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 12:25" />Mataniya, Bakibukiya, Obadiya, Meshulamu; Talumoni na Akubu bari abarinzi b’amarembo bazigama ivyumba vy’ububiko ku marembo. <verse eid="NEH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 12:26" />Bakora mu misi ya Yoyakimu mwene Yesuwa, Yesuwa mwene Yozadaki, no musi ya Nehemiya umukuru w’intara no mu gihe ca Ezira umuherezi n’umwigisha w’Ivyanditswe.<verse eid="NEH 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bashikiriza Imana uruzitiro rw’i Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 12:27" />Mu gihe co gushikiriza Imana uruzitiro rw’i Yerusalemu, baja kurondera Abalewi aho baba barabazana i Yerusalemu ngo bahimbaze mu munezero ukwo gushikiriza Imana uruzitiro bakoresheje indirimbo z’ishimwe bongera bavuza ivyuma bisama, inanga n’amakembe. <verse eid="NEH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 12:28" />Abaririmvyi na bo nyene babegeraniriza hamwe bavuye mu turere dukikuje Yerusalemu, bava mu bigwati vy’Abanetofati, <verse eid="NEH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 12:29" />bava i Beti-Gilugali, no mu karere k’i Geba n’i Azimaveti, kuko abaririmvyi bari barubatse ibigwati vyabo ahakikuje Yerusalemu. <verse eid="NEH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 12:30" />Abaherezi n’Abalewi babanje kwihumanura, hanyuma bahumanura abantu, amarembo n’uruzitiro.<verse eid="NEH 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 12:31" />Maze ndugana abarongozi b’i Buyuda baja ku ruzitiro hejuru. Nongera kandi nkoranya imigwi ibiri y’abaririmvyi bo gushimira Imana. Umugwi wa mbere ugendagenda ku ruzitiro hejuru utumbereye i buryo, ushika kw’Irembo ry’Umwavu. <verse eid="NEH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 12:32" />Hoshaya n’igice c’abarongozi b’i Buyuda barabakurikira, <verse eid="NEH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NEH 12:33" />bari kumwe na Azariya, Ezira, Meshulamu, <verse eid="NEH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NEH 12:34" />Yuda, Benyamini, Shemaya, Yeremiya, <verse eid="NEH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NEH 12:35" />hamwe n’abaherezi bamwe bafise inzamba, kandi na Zakariya mwene Yonatani, Yonatani mwene Shemaya, Shemaya mwene Mataniya, Mataniya mwene Mikaya, Mikaya mwene Zakuri, Zakuri mwene Asafu, <verse eid="NEH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NEH 12:36" />n’abo nyene bari bafatanije, Shemaya, Azareli, Milalayi, Gilalayi, Mayayi, Netaneli, Yuda na Hanani, bafise ibicurarangisho vyategetswe na Dawidi umuntu w’Imana. Ezira umwigisha w’Ivyanditswe ni we yari abarongoye. <verse eid="NEH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NEH 12:37" />Maze bageze kw’Irembo ry’Iriba, babandanya baduga ingazi zija mu Gisagara ca Dawidi ku kadugo kaja ku ruzitiro, hanyuma baca hejuru y’ingoro ya Dawidi berekeye kw’Irembo ry’Amazi, ahaherereye mu buseruko.<verse eid="NEH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NEH 12:38" />Umugwi wa kabiri ugendagenda ku ruzitiro, ugenda werekeye i bubamfu kandi utazira Imana. Ndabakurikira ku ruzitiro, turi kumwe n’igice c’abantu, duca hejuru y’umunara w’amatanure twerekeye ku ruzitiro rwagutse, <verse eid="NEH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NEH 12:39" />hanyuma turengana Irembo rya Efurayimu, Irembo rya Yeshana, Irembo ry’Amafi, umunara wa Hananeli n’Umunara w’Amajana, gushika kw’Irembo ry’Intama. Bashitse kw’Irembo ry’Umurinzi barahagarara.<verse eid="NEH 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NEH 12:40" />Ya migwi y’abaririmvyi yaririmba amashimwe iraheza ifata ibibanza vyayo mu Ngoro y’Imana; na jewe nyene mfata ikibanza ndi kumwe n’igice c’abanyacubahiro, <verse eid="NEH 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NEH 12:41" />hamwe n’abaherezi, Eliyakimu, Mayaseya, Miniyamini, Mikaya, Eliyowenayi, Zakariya na Hananiya bafise inzamba zabo, <verse eid="NEH 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NEH 12:42" />hamwe na Mayaseya, Shemaya, Eliyazeri, Uzi, Yehohanani, Malikiya, Elamu na Ezeri. Ya migwi iririmba indirimbo barongowe na Yezirahiya. <verse eid="NEH 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NEH 12:43" />Maze kuri uwo musi batanga ibimazi bihambaye, banezerewe kuko Imana yari yabahaye umunezero mwinshi. Abagore n’abana na bo nyene baranezerwa, kandi umunezero wa Yerusalemu wumvikana gushika kure cane.<verse eid="NEH 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NEH 12:44" />Muri ico gihe abagabo bari batoranijwe ngo bazezwe ivyumba vy’ububiko burimwo ivyeze imbere y’ibindi, ibigiracumi n’intererano. Bazana mu bubiko imigabane yategetswe mu Vyagezwe babikuye mu mirima ikikije ibisagara babizanira abaherezi n’Abalewi, kuko Abayuda bari bahimbawe n’uko ahaherezi n’Abalewi bari ku gikorwa cabo. <verse eid="NEH 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NEH 12:45" />Bakora igikorwa c’Imana yabo n’igikorwa co guhumanura, nk’uko n’abaririmvyi n’abarinzi b’irembo na bo nyene bakoze, kandi nk’uko Dawidi n’umuhungu wiwe Salomo bari barategetse. <verse eid="NEH 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NEH 12:46" />Mu bihe vya kera, mu bihe vya Dawidi na Asafu, hari abakuru b’abaririmvyi n’ab’indirimbo zo guhimbaza n’iz’ishimwe ku Mana. <verse eid="NEH 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NEH 12:47" />Nuko mu misi ya Zerubabeli na Nehemiya, Abisirayeli bose baraterera ku musi ku musi imigabane y’abaririmvyi n’abarinzi b’irembo. Abalewi barategura kandi imigabane y’abakomoka kuri Aroni.<verse eid="NEH 12:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NEH 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyo Nehemiya yaherejeko guhindura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 13:1" />Kuri uwo musi igitabu ca Mose gisomerwa abantu, maze basanga handitswemwo ko ata Mwamoni canke Umunyamowabu azokwigera yemererwa kwinjira mw’ikoraniro ry’Imana, <verse eid="NEH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 13:2" />kuko batasanganije Abisirayeli ivyokurya canke amazi, ahubwo baciye bahamagara Balamu ngo abavume. Ariko, Imana yacu ica ihindura uwo muvumo uba umuhezagiro. <verse eid="NEH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 13:3" />Abantu bumvise ico cagezwe, baca basohora abanyamahanga b’ikivange bari mw’ikoraniro.<verse eid="NEH 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 13:4" />Imbere y’ivyo, Eliyashibu umuherezi yari yashinzwe kugenzura ivyumba vy’ububiko vyo mu Ngoro y’Imana yacu. Yari afatanije cane na Tobiya, <verse eid="NEH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 13:5" />kandi yari yamuhaye icumba kinini cahora kibikwamwo amashikanwa y’ibivuye mu ntete, ibimota neza n’ibikoresho bitandukanye vyo mu Ngoro. Kera ni ho habikwa kandi ibigiracumi vy’ifu, umutobe w’umuvinyu mushasha, amavuta yandikiwe Abalewi, abaririmvyi n’abarinzi b’amarembo, hamwe n’intererano zateguriwe abaherezi.<verse eid="NEH 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 13:6" />Ariko mu gihe ivyo vyariko biraba, jewe sinari i Yerusalemu, kuko mu mwaka wa mirongo itatu na kabiri Ahasuwerusi ari ku ngoma i Babiloni nari nasubiye ku mwami. Haheze igihe ndamusaba uruhusha, <verse eid="NEH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 13:7" />nca ngaruka i Yerusalemu. Maze nca menya ibibi Eliyashibu yari yakoze mu guha icumba Tobiya mu rugo rw’Ingoro y’Imana. <verse eid="NEH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 13:8" />Birambabaza cane nca nterera hanze ibintu vyose vyari ivya Tobiya ndabikura muri ico cumba. <verse eid="NEH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 13:9" />Ntegeka ko bahumanura ivyo vyumba, maze nca nsubiza muri vyo ibikoresho vyo mu Ngoro y’Imana, hamwe n’amashikanwa y’ifu n’ibimota neza.<verse eid="NEH 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 13:10" />Namenye kandi ko ivyari vyaragerewe Abalewi batabihabwa, kandi ko Abalewi bose n’abaririmvyi bajejwe igikorwa bari bisubiriye mu matongo yabo. <verse eid="NEH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 13:11" />Nuko mbaza abakuru ndabakarira nti: “Ni kubera iki Ingoro y’Imana ititaweho?” Nca rero ndabakoranya ndabashira mu bibanza vyabo.<verse eid="NEH 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 13:12" />Abayuda bose bazana ibigiracumi vyabo vy’intete, umutobe musha w’umuvinyu n’amavuta mu bubiko. <verse eid="NEH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 13:13" />Nshiraho Shelemiya umuherezi, Zadoki umwigisha w’Ivyanditswe, n’Umulewi yitwa Pedaya ngo bazezwe ububiko, na Hanani mwene Zakuri, Zakuri mwene Mataniya, ngo abafashe, kuko abo bagabo bari bazwi ko ari abizigirwa. Bari bajejwe kugaburira benewabo ivyatanzwe.<verse eid="NEH 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 13:14" />Uze unyibuke kuri ivyo, ewe Mana yanje, kandi ntuze uhanagure ivyo nakoze mu bwizigirwa ku bw’Ingoro yawe n’ibikorwa biyikorerwamwo.<verse eid="NEH 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 13:15" />Muri iyo misi mbona abagabo b’i Buyuda bagana mu bwato bw’inzabibu kw’Isabato, bongera binjiza ingano bakaziremeka ku ndogoba, hamwe n’umuvinyu, inzabibu, insukoni n’iyindi mizigo y’uburyo bwose. Kandi bazana ivyo vyose i Yerusalemu kw’Isabato. Nuko nca ndabagabisha ngo ntibagurishe ivyokurya kuri uwo musi. <verse eid="NEH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 13:16" />Abantu bava i Tiro baba i Yerusalemu bazana ifi n’ubwoko bwose bw’ibidandazwa bakabigurishiriza i Yerusalemu kw’Isabato ku bantu b’i Buyuda. <verse eid="NEH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 13:17" />Ntonganya abakuru b’i Buyuda, maze ndababwira nti: “Murabona ikibi muriko murakora mu guhumanya umusi w’Isabato? <verse eid="NEH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 13:18" />Mbega ba sogokuruza banyu ntibakoze nk’ivyo, gushika aho Imana irekura ibi vyago kuri twebwe no kuri kino gisagara? None raba muriko muravyura ubundi burake ku Bisirayeli mu guhumanya Isabato.”<verse eid="NEH 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 13:19" />Igitutu kimaze gushika ku marembo y’i Yerusalemu imbere y’uko Isabato itangura, ntegeka ko inzugi zugarwa ntizugururwe Isabato idaheze. Nshiraho bamwe mu bantu banje ku marembo kugira ngo ntihagire umuzigo n’umwe winjizwa ku musi w’Isabato. <verse eid="NEH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 13:20" />Abagura n’abagurisha ibidandazwa vy’ubwoko butandukanye bararaye inyuma y’i Yerusalemu rimwe canke kabiri. <verse eid="NEH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 13:21" />Ariko ndababurira mvuga nti: “Ni kuki murara hanze inyuma y’uruzitiro? Nimwasubira gukora mutyo, nzoca ndabafata.” Kuva ico gihe ntibasubiriye kuza kw’Isabato. <verse eid="NEH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 13:22" />Nca ntegeka Abalewi kwihumanura ngo bagende kurinda amarembo kugira ngo Isabato igume ari iyera.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 13:22" />
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:22">Uze unyibukire kuri ivyo na vyo, ewe Mana yanje, ungirire imbabazi nk’uko urukundo rwawe rwinshi ruri.<verse eid="NEH 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 13:23" />Vyongeye, muri iyo misi mbona abantu b’i Buyuda bari bararongoye abagore bo muri Ashidodi, muri Amoni n’i Mowabu. <verse eid="NEH 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 13:24" />Igice c’abana babo bavuga ururimi rw’i Ashidodi canke ururimi rw’ayandi mahanga, kandi batashobora kuvuga ururimi rw’Abayuda. <verse eid="NEH 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 13:25" />Ndabatatira ndabaturako umuvumo. Nkubita bamwe mu bagabo ndabakwega umushatsi. Ndabarahiza mw’izina ry’Imana ndavuga nti: “Ntimukwiye gushingira abakobwa banyu abahungu babo, canke ngo mushingire abahungu banyu abakobwa babo canke ngo mubagire abagore banyu. <verse eid="NEH 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 13:26" />Mbega si uko Salomo umwami w’Abisirayeli yacumuye? Mu mahanga menshi nta mwami yari ameze nka we. Yakundwa n’Imana cane, kandi Imana yamwimitse ngo abe umwami w’Abisirayeli bose, ariko yakwegewe mu vyaha n’abagore b’abanyamahangakazi. <verse eid="NEH 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 13:27" />None birabereye kwumva ko namwe muriko murakora icaha kingana gityo, mugatakaza ubwizigirwa ku Mana yacu mu kurongora abagore b’abanyamahangakazi?”<verse eid="NEH 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 13:28" />Umwe mu bahungu ba Yoyada mwene Eliyashibu umuherezi mukuru yari umukwe wa Sanibalati Umuhoroni. Maze ndamwigiza kure yanje.<verse eid="NEH 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 13:29" />Ubibuke, ewe Mana yanje, kuko bahumanije igikorwa c’ubuherezi, n’isezerano ry’ubuherezi n’iry’Abalewi.<verse eid="NEH 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 13:30" />Nuko mpumanura abaherezi n’Abalewi ndabatandukanya n’ikintu cose c’ikinyamahanga, nca ndabashinga ibikorwa, umwe wese igikorwa ciwe. <verse eid="NEH 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 13:31" />Nca nongera nshinga ko habaho kuzana amashikanwa y’inkwi mu bihe vyashinzwe, n’ivyeze imbere y’ibindi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 13:31" />
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 13:31">Uze unyibukane imbabazi, ewe Mana yanje.<verse eid="NEH 13:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 13" />
</usx>